#### Phase 3: BaseController Refactor (Week 4)
- [ ] Extract traits: `HasCsrfProtection`, `HasRateLimiting`, `HasTenantScope`, `HasJsonResponses`, `HasViewRendering`, `HasFlashMessages`, `HasSecurityHeaders`
- [ ] Reduce BaseController to ~500 lines
