- [ ] Queue workers: `php bin/console messenger:consume notifications emails sms pdf reports`
- [ ] Dead letter queue + retry policy (3 retries, exponential backoff)

#### Phase 7: Unified Identity (Week 8)
- [ ] Create profile tables: `customer_profiles`, `associate_profiles`, `employee_profiles`, `agent_profiles`
- [ ] Migrate data from `customers`, `associates`, `agents`, `employees`
- [ ] Update all FKs, controllers, services
- [ ] Deprecate old tables

#### Phase 8: Router Replacement + OpenAPI (Week 9) — NOT NEEDED ✅
- **Assessment**: Router replacement not needed (see Phase 5). OpenAPI spec created manually at `docs/openapi.json` with 19 key endpoints. `zircote/swagger-php` installed for incremental annotation scanning.
- **OpenAPI annotations** can be added incrementally to controllers as needed (zero risk)
- **Mobile SDK** can be generated from `docs/openapi.json` using `openapi-generator`
- **See**: `docs/ROUTER_REPLACEMENT_PLAN.md` for full analysis

