### Safety Gates (Every Phase)
1. **Before any code change**: `php testing/master_test_runner.php` — must be 10/10
2. **After each service merge**: Full test suite + probe affected endpoints
3. **Before DB migration**: Safety dump + byte-identical restore test
4. **After router change**: Full endpoint probe (all 200+ routes)
5. **No phase complete** until 10/10 master tests + 37/37 Flutter tests pass

