### Key Lessons (Carried Forward)
_678. **Service deduplication requires reference tracking** — Every service reference in 200+ controllers must be updated; use IDE "Find Usages" + grep before deleting.
_679. **BaseController refactor needs trait composition** — Single inheritance limits flexibility; traits allow selective inclusion.
_680. **DB indexes must be verified with EXPLAIN** — Add index, run EXPLAIN on top 10 slow queries, verify index usage.
_681. **Queue workers need dead letter handling** — Failed jobs after 3 retries → dead letter table + alert.

