### Key Lessons (carried, continued)
_674. **CEO AI needs real-time data, not cached** — Executive decisions need live metrics; direct DB queries beat cached dashboards for accuracy
_675. **String interpolation in PHP can't use `??` or `+` operators** — Calculate values first, then interpolate; `{$var1 + $var2}` inside strings is a parse error
_676. **CEO AI needs fallback summaries** — When AI providers fail, structured fallback with real metrics maintains trust and utility
_677. **Predefined actions > open-ended chat for executives** — CEOs prefer one-click briefings (`daily_briefing`, `weekly_review`) over typing questions; both supported
