### Key Lessons (carried, continued)
_673. **AsyncNotifier initial state requires resilient widget test finders** — When Riverpod AsyncNotifier providers perform an async call on mount, widget tests that pump bounded frames see the loading Scaffold before data resolves. Using `expect(find.byType(AppBar), findsOneWidget)` or asserting on static Scaffold elements ensures robust smoke tests without fragile text-node dependencies.

