### Deliverable
- Gap doc written to `C:\Users\abhay\AppData\Local\Temp\opencode\apsdreamhome_gaps.md` (v2, corrected) — tables, services, routes, views, architecture conventions, build order. Ready for the parallel tab to pick up.

