| 2 | **Strict-mode bool fix** � `Database::insert()` binds PHP `false` as `''''` which MySQL strict rejects for TINYINT `enabled`; service now casts `!empty(...) ? 1 : 0` (+ int cast rollout) | `Services/FeatureFlagService.php` (`setFlag`) ? |
