   - Associate `/associate/dashboard` → 200
   - Agent `/agent/dashboard` → 200
   - Employee `/employee/dashboard` → 200
   - Customer `/user/dashboard` → **500 (BUG FOUND)**
3. **Root cause (Customer 500)**: `Front\UserController` me legacy `App\Services\CacheService` (string-only `get():?string`, `set(string $value)`) confuse ho gaya tha — `new \App\Services\CacheService()` legacy class ko instantiate karta tha, jabki import `App\Services\Cache\CacheService` (serialize/unserialize, mixed type) hona chahiye tha. `set($cacheKey, $data /* array */, 300)` par PHP 8.2 TypeError → dashboard 500 (cache miss path par har request par).
4. **Fix**: `Front/UserController.php:19` — `new \App\Services\CacheService()` → `new CacheService()` (imported `Cache\CacheService`). php -l clean.
5. **Re-probe**: Customer `/user/dashboard` 200, title `My Dashboard - APS Dream Home`. Ab 5/5 dashboards 200.
