- ✅ Portal probe 5/5 dashboards 200 after fix (customer 500→200)
- ✅ **Master 10/10 PASSED** (20.78s)
- ✅ DB zero drift (no schema change)
- ✅ Probe hygiene: `probe_dashboards.php` + `dump_500.php` in Temp, cleaned same turn

### Key Lessons (carried, continued)
_688. **Two CacheService classes (legacy string-only vs new serialize) = silent TypeError 500** — `new \App\Services\CacheService()` vs `new CacheService()` (imported `Cache\CacheService`) ka antar dashboard par 500 bana raha tha; namespace fully-qualified override import ko bypass kar deta hai. Cache use se pehle `php -l` + namespace check karo.
_689. **agent-browser CLI timeout != app down** — headless daemon latency me `open` 120s timeout hota hai jabki site curl se 200 milti hai; vision (webfetch/curl) se functional test reliable hai, visual screenshot ke liye headed browser chahiye hoga.

