_699. **Analyze error ko full-file read se verify karo — stale version ho sakta hai** — pehla analyze 259 `;` unexpected bola, but abhi wahi file `No issues found` de raha hai jab do warnings fix kiye gaye. Analyze output ko file ki current state se match karo, stale error par blind fix mat karo.

