## Session 374: Identity FK Audit + Restructure Plan (Read-Only, 10/10 + 37/37 Green) (2026-11-08)

### Trigger
User: "do next" after S373 (Messenger Dashboard + EXPLAIN + CSP Audit). Deep context check: platform optimization plan me remaining blocked item = 30 services ka FK restructure (owner approval + 60-120h estimated). Is round me usko chheda nahi — pehle live audit kiya taaki plan numbers sahi hon.

### Work (read-only audit + plan doc, zero DB writes)
1. **Health verify**: Backend **10/10 PASSED** (20.79s), Flutter **37/37 passed**, DB `users 137 / plots 756 / leads 38687 / colonies 7` — zero drift.
2. **Profile schema verify**: `employee_profiles/associate_profiles` me `legacy_id` bridge exists (`->employees.id / associates.id`) + `user_id BIGINT UNSIGNED -> users.id` — backfill possible without guessing.
3. **Coverage gap found**: `employees 17 vs profiles 15` (2 without profile), `associates 38 vs profiles 37` (1 without profile) — 3 missing profiles are Wave-0 blocker.
4. **JOIN audit (recursive)**: **33 unique service files** still reference legacy `employees/associates`
   (tracking doc ka 30/36 stale hai; 6 files partial-migrated hain — simple lookups IdentityService se, JOINs baaki).
5. **Dependent-table data audit (key overturn)**: `salary_structures, course_assignments, helpdesk_tickets,
   expense_claims, attendance, grievances, overtime_requests, performance_reviews, survey_responses` — **sab 0 rows**.
   `salary_payments 9 rows`, `plot_bookings 3 rows (all NULL)`. Old doc ki kai tables live exist hi nahi karti
   (`fnf_settlements, gratuity_records, org_hierarchy, shift_swaps` etc.) — un services ka migration code-only hai, data risk zero.
   `INT(11)` associate_id columns (`plot_bookings, commission_advances, mlm_payouts`...) legacy PK point karti hain — BIGINT convert Wave-0 me.
6. **Plan doc**: `docs/IDENTITY_FK_RESTRUCTURE_PLAN.md` — Wave 0 (blockers) -> Wave 1 (empty-table code-only)
   -> Wave 2 (sparse-table backfill+code) -> Wave 3 (money tables, owner approval) -> Wave 4 (routers), per-service
   safety-dump + dual-write + rollback steps ke saath. Recommendation: batch mat karo; Wave 0+1 next (16-24h), review, phir Wave 2/3.

### Verification
- ✅ Backend 10/10, Flutter 37/37, DB zero drift (koi DB write nahi is round)
- ✅ `docs/IDENTITY_FK_RESTRUCTURE_PLAN.md` created (audit-backed numbers)
- ✅ Probe hygiene: sirf `mysql.exe -e` read-only selects + grep, koi temp script nahi bana

