### Key Lessons (carried, continued)
_704. **Empty dependent tables overturn blanket "NOT SAFE"** - jab `helpdesk_tickets/salary_structures/course_assignments` me 0 rows hain, FK restructure data risk zero hai; tracking doc ka 60-120h estimate live counts ke bina theater tha. Har migration estimate se pehle `TABLE_ROWS` audit karo.
_705. **legacy_id bridge makes backfill deterministic** - `employee_profiles.legacy_id -> employees.id` aur `user_id -> users.id` dono exist karte hain, isliye `UPDATE ... JOIN` backfill guess-free hai; jahan bridge nahi, wahan mapping owner se pucho.
_706. **Two CacheService-ish traps repeat** - same as _688: namespace/import confusion 500 deta hai; is repo me har naye service me `php -l` + namespace grep lazmi hai (is round koi code change nahi, sirf audit).

