_713. **Mobile pages that look 200-clean may still hide analyzer errors until wired** — router imports forced the whole app_router to type-check; ambiguous imports (`PropertyValuationPage` ×2) surfaced only after routing. Analyzer on file alone says 0 errors, full-project says otherwise. Always analyze the router after adding pages.
_714. **TenantContext namespace trap repeats (3rd time)** — `\App\Core\TenantContext` vs `\App\Core\Middleware\TenantContext`. S371/S375 already hit this; photo endpoints (parallel actor's commit) regressed. Grep `TenantContext::` before any new AI controller.
_715. **`properties` has no `name` column** — suggestions/code that assume `plots.name` 1054. Real: `plot_number` + `description` + `facing`. `colonies` has `location`, not `city`. Phantom columns are the #1 500 cause in this repo.

