### Key Lessons (carried, continued)
_721. **Money table backfill needs 2 passes, not 1** — `salary_payments.employee_id` me 1 row profile-bridge se mili, 4 rows direct `users.id` se, 2 dangling rahi. Sirf profile pass = 4 rows galat NULL rehti. Live cross-check (`users` me exist karta hai ya nahi) decide karta hai kaunsa pass lagega — assume mat karo.
_722. **Master 9/10 me failure ko meri change se mat jodo bina probe ke** — `/api/health` 500 meri files se impossible tha (SystemController load hi nahi karta), lekin CLI dispatch probe ne asal fatal (signature mismatch) name kar diya. Wartime (Wave 3) me bhi collateral fix ek line hai, par attribution hamesha probe se.

