4. **PayrollBatchService** (dual-write + dual-read):
   - `generateMonth()` INSERT: `user_id` column add kiya — value `(SELECT user_id FROM employee_profiles WHERE legacy_id=? OR user_id=? OR id=? LIMIT 1)` subquery (3 params; profile nahi = NULL honest). Params 11 → **14** (employee_id + 3 subquery + struct + month + year + date + 5 amounts + by). **Probe ne 13-vs-14 mismatch pakda** (net_amount ka ek `?` chhoot gaya tha) — fix ke baad 14=14 match.
   - `getEmployeePayslips()`: `LEFT JOIN users u ON sp.employee_id=u.id` → `u.id = COALESCE(sp.user_id, sp.employee_id)`, filter `(sp.employee_id=? OR sp.user_id=?)` (2 params) — S383 rows (user_id backfilled) + purani rows dono milti hain
   - `getActiveStructures()` — already users.id direction, untouched; `processPayments()` PF sync untouched (dono side same column)

