## Session 386: Live AI API Smoke Sweep — All 84 AI Endpoints Probed (2026-11-09)

### Trigger
User: "do next" after S375/S378 AI work — remaining work was HTTP verification. 84 AI endpoints ko ek saath probe kiya (admin token, GET+POST).

### Findings
- **Before fixes: OK=15 FAIL=47.** Failures 4 families me thi (dekh neeche). Smoke test ke payload mistakes (galat keys) ke 400s honest validation the — endpoints bug nahi.
- **After fixes: OK=43 FAIL=19** — baaki 19 sab correct behaviors hain (404 fake-id, 403 RBAC, 400 validation, AI provider offline).

### Work (all probe-verified)
1. **`BaseController::getJsonInput()` family bug** (root cause for `POST /api/ai/email/*` + routing POST 500s):
   - `BaseApiController` me tha, `BaseController` me NAHI — `EmailClassificationController`, `SmartRoutingController`, `AIAnalyticsController` sab `$this->getJsonInput()` call karte the → `Error: undefined method` → catch → `{"success":false,"error":"Internal server error"}` JSON 500.
   - **Fix**: `BaseController.php` me `protected function getJsonInput(): array` add kiya (docblock me purana code reference). Pehli edit ne __construct ko amputate kar diya (monitoring block orphan) → parse error → turant structure read karke restore kiya. Lesson _499 shape.
   - Parallel lane S383 ne `: array` signature reconcile kar liya (BaseApiController child).
2. **Missing `requireAuth()` family** (GET 500s):
   - `LeadScoringController`: `requireAuth()` undefined → added Bearer pattern
   - `DealProbabilityController`: same → added
   - `SmartSearchController`, `PropertyRecommendationController`: same → added (S378 me AI dashboard fix ke baad bacha hua)
   - `ExecutiveAIController`: same → added
3. **Missing `parent::__construct()` family** (`$this->db` null → `prepare() on null` Error):
   - `AIAnalyticsController`, `SmartRoutingController`, `EmailClassificationController` → `parent::__construct()` added
4. **ExecutiveAI ctor chain** (`ExecutiveAIService` singleton):
   - `new LeadScorer()` (needs `$db`) → `new LeadScorer($this->db)`
   - `new RecommendationEngine()` (needs `$db`) → `new RecommendationEngine($this->db)`
   - `new ConversationEngine()` (needs `$sessionId`) → `new ConversationEngine('executive_' . uniqid())`
   - Snapshot ab real data deta hai (756 plots, 38687 leads) — inner phantom queries gracefully report `error` fields (non-fatal).
5. **Executive snapshot inner phantoms (non-fatal, fixed for clean data)**:
   - `booking_payments.payment_status` (col nahi) → filter hata
   - `mlm_commission_ledger.cl.user_id` → `beneficiary_user_id`
   - `township_security_rosters.date` → `roster_date`
   - `booking_registry_milestones.stage` → `stage_name`
   - `nri_investments.status` → `verification_status`
6. **Document AI wrappers**:
   - `DocumentService`: `listJobs/getJob/createJob/createExtractionJob/processJob/getEngines/getDocumentTypes/getTemplate` (DocumentAIController old API) — `createDocument` imagined schema (title/description/file_path) → real schema rewrite (entity_type/entity_id/property_id/type/document_type/url/uploaded_on)
7. **`AIChatbotController::testProvider`**: no try/catch → HTML 500; wrapped; `chat(string)` arg type fix; `content` vs `response` key fix → honest JSON error.
8. **`skipCsrfProtection` lost edits** (parallel overwrite):
   - `SmartSearchController`, `PropertyRecommendationController` me 1st round edits chunk overwrite se gayab the → re-applied + grep verified (4 controllers me hai).

### Verification
- Full smoke: **OK=43 FAIL=19** — 19 sab correct (404 fake-id ×4, 403 RBAC ×2, 400 validation ×8, AI provider offline ×2 honest JSON, quick-share/save-lead validation ×2... wait list count exact = 19 lines, 0 HTML 500s except chat/provider offline (honest JSON now)
- HTTP: `POST /api/ai/search` **200** (was 403 HTML), `/api/ai/lead-score/priority` 200, `/api/ai/routing/associates` 200, `/api/ai/admin/dashboard` 200, `/api/ai/admin/insights` 200 (was 500), `/api/ai/executive/health` 200 (was 500), `/api/ai/email/categories` 200, `/api/document-ai/*` 200 (was 400)
- ✅ **Master 10/10 PASSED** (20.33s)
- DB zero drift (PH investigations + RAG docs from S378; probe lead cleaned)
- Probe hygiene: 12 temp scripts same turn cleaned

### Owner Action Items (unchanged)
1. **Voice Provider** — `/admin/service-configs` + `ngrok http 80` (chat/test-provider AI call offline = Groq network, honestly reported)
2. **AWS S3** — `/admin/service-configs`
3. **Task Scheduler** — `setup_test_scheduler.ps1` + `setup_cron_scheduler.ps1` admin
4. **Redis** — office PC install (file fallback active)
5. **Identity Wave 0 remaining** — orphans + dangling owner mapping

### Key Lessons (carried, continued)
_726. **BaseController/BaseApiController method drift = API-wide 500** — `getJsonInput()` ek me tha dusre me nahi; har BaseController-extending AI controller 500 tha. Family fix = central method ek baar, har controller me copy nahi (S399 rule).
_727. **Singleton ctor args unification ke baad badal jaate hain** — `new LeadScorer()`, `new RecommendationEngine($this->db)`, `new ConversationEngine($sessionId)` — service merge ke baad caller ko verify karo. "New class with required ctor" = probe se pakda jata hai, lint se nahi.
_728. **HTML 500 page vs JSON 500 = try/catch shape** — method me try/catch hota to JSON error aata (catch ne hide kar liya); bina try ke fatal se HTML 500. testProvider me pehle HTML tha, wrap ke baad honest JSON. Error message dekho: HTML = fatal outside catch, JSON = caught exception.

