- **Navbar & Menus Walk (58 items):** Tested all navbar links sequentially in authenticated & unauthenticated browser sessions (`/`, `/properties`, `/properties?listing=sale`, `/properties?type=residential`, `/featured-properties`, `/auctions`, `/colonies`). All links landed on their intended routes with `200 OK` (0 broken links, 0 dead anchors).
