## Session 419: User Polish Implementation + Silent Bug Fixes (Attendance, Gamification, Rate Limiting, Valuation) (2026-11-09)

### Trigger
User request: "ok kar do sab apne suggestion se" — Implement all suggestions surfaced from automated browser and error log analysis during testing.

### Work Completed

#### 1. Employee Attendance Query Fix (`app/Http/Controllers/Employee/EmployeeController.php`)
- **Fix:** Line 443 query updated from `ORDER BY attendance_date DESC, check_in DESC` to `ORDER BY attendance_date DESC, check_in_time DESC`.
- **Reason:** Real schema for `employee_attendance` contains `check_in_time`, not `check_in`. Resolved silent failure returning empty attendance history.

#### 2. Agent Dashboard Brokerage Query & Caching (`app/Http/Controllers/Agent/AgentDashboardController.php`)
- **Fix 1:** Removed phantom column `brokerage_flat_fee` from SQL query on line 410.
- **Fix 2:** Updated booking query `pb.associate_id = ...` to `pb.user_id = ?`.
- **Optimization:** Added 5-minute cache (`agent_dashboard:...`) via `CacheService` to reduce redundant queries on agent dashboard.

#### 3. Gamification Cache Helper (`app/Services/CacheService.php`)
- **Fix:** Implemented `public static function getGamification(string $role, int $k1, int $k2, callable $callback): array`.
- **Behavior:** Resolves undefined method call from `AgentDashboardController::safeGamify()`, caches to Redis (TTL 300s) with fallback to raw callback if Redis is unavailable.

#### 4. Property Valuation Tool Polish (`app/views/pages/tools/property_valuation.php`)
- **UX Polish:** Added explicit "Calculate Valuation" button with `calcVal(true)`.
- **Interactivity:** On click, performs smooth scroll to `#valuationResults` with scale pulse animation for visual feedback.

#### 5. Rate Limiting Human-Friendly Response (`app/Middleware/RateLimiter.php`)
- **Enhancement:** When a web user exceeds the rate limit (HTTP_ACCEPT containing `text/html`), renders a clean, styled HTML card with Retry-After and Go Back action instead of raw JSON.

#### 6. YouTube Tour Video CSP Directive (`app/Helpers/SecurityHelper.php`, `app/Http/Controllers/Traits/HasSecurityHeaders.php`)
- **Fix:** Added `https://www.youtube.com https://www.youtube-nocookie.com` to `frame-src`. Eliminates CSP framing violations on colony detail pages (`/colony/suryoday-colony`).

### Verification Results
- ✅ **PHP Lint:** 0 syntax errors detected across all modified files (`php -l`).
- ✅ **Master Test Suite Runner:** 10/10 suites PASSED (100% HEALTHY, 22.47s).
- ✅ **Database Integrity:** Zero database drift (users: 75, plots: 756, leads: 986, plot_bookings: 3, payments: 24, colonies: 7).
- ✅ **Probe Hygiene:** Zero leftover temporary files; all probe scripts cleaned up immediately.

